  "note": "青石村 (README: 三面环山, 产石材. 因山壁上覆满青苔而得名): grey-green stone everywhere — the slab road with its ruts, the square of great blocks, houses of dry-laid stone under stone-slab roofs, the cut cliff of the quarry — moss on every face and in every joint, earth-brown yards and wood, the hills close round on three sides. Colours 青灰, 苔绿, 土褐; nothing of 雪亭镇's blossom, 水烟阁's maples or 绮云镇's grey-blue tiles.",
